# Search fence for ripgrep and the agents that use it. Everything here is
# still in the repository; `rg -uu` searches it all.

# Test fixtures, oracle captures and receipts (binary or machine-written)
tests/data/
tests/fixtures/
docs/public/receipts/

# Rust code we do not edit: the project's own vendored crates
tools/*/vendor/

# Generated or built Metal artifacts
woof/metal/generated/
woof/metal/kernel_signatures.json
woof/libexec/

# Upstream CUDA kernels (read them on purpose when porting a kernel)
*.cu
*.cuh

# Upstream investigation notes and large legal records
tilestream/*.md
PROVENANCE.md
NOTICE
licenses/
woof/physics_registry_history.json
